  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: 2-2B
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Look, who am I to go against the advice of the love guru herself?
  - speaker: 1
    text: Does your heart not beat in that cold rib cage of yours?
  - speaker: 0
    text: "You\u2019re still around aren\u2019t you?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: Well what WE have is special.
  - speaker: 1
    text: SOMETHING NO TRUE LOVE CAN EVER REPLACE
  - speaker: 0
    text: "\u2026"
  - speaker: 0
    text: I should call Hermes.
